        "rationale": "The agent followed the expected tool sequence (fmsr.get_failure_modes -> iot.installed_sensors -> iot.stream_extent -> iot.sensor_stats), addressed all nine returned failure modes, and correctly noted the data window (15-19 Jan 2024, 5 daily records, no nulls). However, it deviated from the task's stated coverage rule: the question defines 'well covered / partially covered / blind' by whether the diagnostic sensors have data in the window, yet the agent re-defined 'partially covered' as a diagno",
